[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0058","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13768","title":"Gardyn IoT Hub 硬编码凭据致未授权远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Gardyn IoT Hub 设备中存在硬编码的 iothubowner 高权限密钥（CWE-798），未经身份认证的远程攻击者通过获取该密钥即可调用 Azure IoT Hub Registry Manager 函数，获取所有 Gardyn Home Kit 和 Studio 设备的连接信息，进而对指定设备执行任意命令，并可利用该设备作为跳板攻击用户内网中的其他设备。CVSS 评分 9.5，危害等级严重。厂商尚未发布官方修复补丁，建议用户立即更换默认密钥并限制 IoT Hub 访问权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13768"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-03T00:16:52.270","updated":"2026-07-06T19:42:32.890","remediation":"立即将 Gardyn Home/Studio 固件升级至 master.627 或更高版本，Gardyn Cloud API 升级至 2.12.2026 或更高，移动 App 升级至 2.11.0 或更高。确保设备持续联网以便自动接收安全更新；在 App 的 Settings → Advanced 中确认固件版本号为 627 及以上。若设备曾离线，重新联网后保持在线直至更新完成。厂商已轮换被泄露的 iothubowner 密钥并部署额外监控措施，用户无需自行配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/develop/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-183-03.json","https://mygardyn.com/security/","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-183-03","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7f6823bc066973da81d3ae0684f0bccdfe7fa7a4/2026/CVE-2026-13768.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-02/TIER_2_CVE-2026-13768.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bb6223196139bc0688b84a1421e9ebaaf1270e61/2026/CVE-2026-13768.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-13768/README.md","https://github.com/J4ck3LSyN-Gen2/Reports/blob/c7ee1544ae03025fd7749dd30f9be169a83d194d/OS-IS-CVE-2026-13768-07-2026.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/278bea3f9397da219bb29098ecf3912d7bfe0645/content/posts/cve-2026-13768.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-13768.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e1686fb6d9ff590e56242cf0983cd0f4c2346da7/docs/2026/Gardyn_IoT_Hub_%E7%A1%AC%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%87%AD%E6%8D%AE%E8%87%B4%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83_RCE_CVE-2026-13768.toml","https://github.com/psocik/ict/blob/754a501733fcc157dd813308ca9704bc2f17e229/_posts/2026/2026-07-02-CVE-2026-13768-Gardyn-IoT-Hub-Use-of-Hard-coded-Credentials.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9bf1bcd98df741ae892c1ba6b8127fb5da623fcc/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13768.json","https://github.com/J4ck3LSyN-Gen2/CVE-2026-13768","https://github.com/MichaelAdamGroberman/CVE-2026-13768","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-13768"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0058.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0058.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0105","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54998","title":"Microsoft Exchange Online 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Exchange Online 存在授权不当漏洞（CWE-863），已获得合法身份认证的攻击者可利用网络向 Exchange Online 服务发送特制请求，绕过权限检查机制实现权限提升，进而访问超出自身授权范围的敏感资源。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Exchange Online 服务，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54998"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-02T23:16:51.137","updated":"2026-07-07T05:16:52.423","remediation":"Microsoft 已于 2026 年 7 月安全更新中服务端修复此漏洞，Exchange Online 用户无需手动安装补丁。建议管理员登录 Microsoft 365 管理门户确认服务健康状态（Service Health Dashboard），确保组织已处于最新更新轨道（Current Channel）。作为纵深防御措施，可启用 Exchange 管理员审计日志（Set-AdminAuditLogConfig -UnifiedAuditLogIngestionEnabled $true）并监控异常权限提升行为，同时遵循最小权限原则审查服务主体（Service Principal）和应用权限分配。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-54998","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2026/CVE-2026-54998.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54998.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54998.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-02/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54998.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/d96cdcee4ef80f9187069a225f8b6e61537923c7/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54998/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-54998.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/78453fda61545f56ec9c1e2f8e5aa78adf2aa3c6/app/routes/posts/2026-07-03_CVE-2026-54998.mdx","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Microsoft_Exchange_Online_%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87_CVE-2026-54998.toml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54998.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b80e198eccaa13040dbe03d79f3c9c06085d067/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-phr2-vr74-whpx/GHSA-phr2-vr74-whpx.json","https://github.com/sentinel-aidefense/CVE-2026-54998-exp","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54998"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0076","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-41106","title":"Microsoft 365 Copilot 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Microsoft 365 Copilot 存在开放重定向漏洞（CWE-601），未经授权的远程攻击者可通过精心构造的 URL 将用户重定向到恶意外部站点，进而通过网络利用该漏洞实现权限提升。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户点击特制链接即可触发。该漏洞影响 Microsoft 365 Copilot 相关组件，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。Microsoft 已在安全更新中对此漏洞进行修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-41106"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-02T23:16:50.867","updated":"2026-07-07T14:24:12.110","remediation":"该漏洞为 Microsoft 365 Copilot 云服务侧漏洞，微软已通过服务端更新完成修复，用户无需手动安装补丁。请确保 Microsoft 365 Copilot 客户端及浏览器扩展更新至最新版本（通过 Microsoft 365 门户检查更新）。作为深度防御措施，建议组织部署 Web 内容过滤策略，对 Copilot 返回的链接进行合法性校验；同时加强用户安全意识培训，避免点击不可信的重定向链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-41106","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-41106"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0108","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55726","title":"Gardyn 物联网中心设备日志存储容器未授权访问漏洞","description":"Gardyn 物联网中心使用的 Azure Blob Storage 容器未配置任何访问认证机制，导致设备日志文件可被公开列举。攻击者无需身份验证即可通过网络远程列出并访问存储容器中的所有设备日志文件，获取设备运行状态、配置信息等敏感数据，属于 CWE-497 敏感系统信息泄露漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55726"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2026-07-02","updated":"2026-07-06","remediation":"将 Gardyn Home Firmware 升级至 master.627 及以上版本，Studio Firmware 升级至 master.627 及以上版本，Cloud API 升级至 2.12.2026 及以上版本；确保设备联网以自动下载固件更新，更新移动应用至最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/develop/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-183-03.json","https://mygardyn.com/security/","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-183-03"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0328","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0328.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49858","title":"API Platform Core 跨用户属性泄漏漏洞","description":"API Platform Core 的 JSON:API 和 HAL 序列化组件中存在跨用户属性泄漏漏洞。`#[ApiProperty(security: ...)]` 注解用于按请求评估属性是否可暴露，但 `ItemNormalizer` 中的 `componentsCache` 数组以 `$context['cache_key']` 为键进行缓存，该键在委托给父级规范化器之前被无条件设置，未包含用户权限信息。因此，一个请求计算出的属性结构（属性、关系、链接）可被后续不同权限用户的请求复用，导致低权限用户看到本应被安全谓词隐藏的属性结构。该漏洞影响 API Platform Core 2.6.0 至 4.1.29、4.2.26 及 4.3.12 之前版本，利用条件包括：应用通过 JSON:API 或 HAL 格式暴露资源、资源属性使用了依赖当前用户的 `security` 谓词、以及运行在 FrankenPHP/RoadRunner/Swoole 等长生命周期 PHP 运行时中（请求间缓存存活）。攻击者可通过构造特定请求顺序触发缓存重用，实现越权信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49858","GHSA-pjhx-3c3w-9v23"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T20:17:10.153","updated":"2026-07-02T18:41:35.990","remediation":"立即升级 api-platform/core、api-platform/json-api 和 api-platform/hal 至 4.1.29、4.2.26 或 4.3.12 及以上版本。如无法升级，可覆写 JSON:API 和 HAL 的 ItemNormalizer 服务，在 $context['cache_key'] 前增加资源类安全检查；或临时避免在 JSON:API/HAL 资源上使用 #[ApiProperty(security: ...)]。将部署切换为传统 php-fpm 工作模式也可缓解，因缓存不会跨请求存活。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/api-platform/core/security/advisories/GHSA-pjhx-3c3w-9v23","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49858.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/packagist/api-platform/hal/CVE-2026-49858.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49858.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-49858.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-49858.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-pjhx-3c3w-9v23/GHSA-pjhx-3c3w-9v23.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49858.json","https://github.com/ProjetsThibaut/sniperland/blob/c5c43f8f2e30e477faf3400b96c1aa0bf8107c93/docs/adr/ADR-035_auth_session_jwt_deferred.md","https://github.com/anchore/vulnerability-index-spec-files/blob/da07e4079d8e007fe062e5c4bb9628bb4caa2d74/data/2026/45/ANCHORE-2026-45773.toml","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/e215f3db28c5769217a5505035d513be33f7dce5/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-19800.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0328.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0242","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0242.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13760","title":"AWS aws-cdk-lib NodejsFunction Docker 捆绑功能操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"AWS CDK（aws-cdk-lib）的 NodejsFunction Docker 捆绑流程中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。当项目使用 nodeModules 参数进行 Docker 构建时，攻击者通过控制 package.json 文件中依赖版本字符串，注入恶意 shell 元字符，可在运行 CDK 工具链的主机上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 aws-cdk-lib 2.260.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.0，危害等级高。攻击者需具备修改项目 package.json 依赖版本字符串的能力，利用条件相对受限但危害严重。官方已在 v2.260.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13760","GHSA-vcrf-j523-4mrf"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-01T19:16:36.157","updated":"2026-07-01T20:17:01.490","remediation":"立即将 aws-cdk-lib 升级至 v2.260.0 或更高版本 (npm update aws-cdk-lib / pip install --upgrade aws-cdk-lib)。如无法立即升级，在 Docker 打包构建过程中严格校验 package.json 中所有依赖版本字符串，过滤 shell 元字符（如 `;&|$`），避免将不可信的用户输入直接传入 NodejsFunction 的 nodeModules 配置项。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://aws.amazon.com/security/security-bulletins/2026-050-aws/","https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk/releases/tag/v2.260.0","https://github.com/aws/aws-cdk/security/advisories/GHSA-vcrf-j523-4mrf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13760.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/aws-cdk-lib/CVE-2026-13760.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_2_CVE-2026-13760.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13760.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-13760.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-13760.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/45bc652ff79f8949ca15d5de8959068671b69187/cve/CVE-2026-13760.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vcrf-j523-4mrf/GHSA-vcrf-j523-4mrf.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-13760.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/fdc85fda51ce30c8d5596698e5c36e14d548cfe1/2026/07/2026-07-02-report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0242.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0120","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6688","title":"ChaN FatFs 长文件名缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FatFs（ChaN FatFs）R0.16 及更早版本在处理长文件名（LFN）时存在下游缓冲区溢出漏洞。当启用 LFN 功能后，`fno.fname` 字段可长达 255 个字符，但许多调用方将其复制到固定长度的短缓冲区时未进行边界检查，导致缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的长文件名文件（如 255 字符的 LFN）触发此漏洞，造成缓冲区写入越界，可能导致内存破坏或代码执行。该漏洞映射为 CWE-120（输入大小未检查的缓冲区复制），CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6688"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:13.013","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:46.120","remediation":"升级 FatFs 到 R0.16 以上版本；在调用 f_readdir() 的代码中，将所有复制 fno.fname 的 strcpy/sprintf 替换为 strncpy/snprintf 并明确限制目标缓冲区大小（如 snprintf(name, sizeof(name), \"%s\", fno.fname)）；如业务不需要长文件名支持，可在 ffconf.h 中将 FF_USE_LFN 设为 0 禁用 LFN 以彻底规避；同时审查项目所有集成 FatFs 的目录遍历代码路径，确保无其他固定缓冲区的越界复制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-long-fn-of-downstream-cve-2026-6688/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6688.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6688.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/sbom.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_3_CVE-2026-6688.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6688.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6688.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_%E9%95%BF%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%8B%E6%B8%B8%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA_CVE-2026-6688.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6688.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5a9fba9a290ea9e3c74c99f6d784969fc4412c6c/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-8vm2-mjff-2gg2/GHSA-8vm2-mjff-2gg2.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/fuzzer/main.go","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6688"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0119","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6687","title":"FatFs exFAT 卷标栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FatFs R0.16 及更早版本中的 f_getlabel() 函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-121）。该漏洞源于程序在处理 exFAT 文件系统卷标时，未对 XDIR_NumLabel 字段长度进行规范上限校验，攻击者可通过挂载特制的 exFAT 镜像文件，设置恶意卷标长度值触发栈缓冲区溢出。该漏洞影响嵌入式系统中广泛使用的 FatFs 文件系统库，物理接触设备的攻击者可利用此漏洞实现任意代码执行或系统崩溃，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6687"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12.870","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:40.173","remediation":"升级至 FatFs R0.17 或更高版本（官方已修复）。如无法升级，手动修补 `ff.c` 中 `f_getlabel()` 函数，在调用 `ld_utf8()` 写入卷标前增加对 `XDIR_NumLabel` 的校验，限制其最大值为 22（exFAT 规范上限）。临时缓解措施：禁止程序挂载来源不可信的 exFAT 镜像文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-exfat-label-len-of-cve-2026-6687/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6687.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6687.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/src/ff.c","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_3_CVE-2026-6687.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6687.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6687.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_exFAT_%E5%8D%B7%E6%A0%87%E6%A0%88%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA_CVE-2026-6687.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6687.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3346902a1d1e44903f43a6ca4d63e2601447c63c/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-wghw-hg6m-7rh3/GHSA-wghw-hg6m-7rh3.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/fuzzer/main.go","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6687"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0118","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6686","title":"FatFs f_lseek 越界后未初始化簇读取信息泄露漏洞","description":"FatFs R0.16 及更早版本中存在未初始化簇信息泄露漏洞。当通过 f_lseek() 函数将文件扩展至 EOF 之后时，新分配的簇未被清零即被使用，导致残留的磁盘数据可能被读取。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的 FAT 镜像文件，诱导目标系统处理该文件后读取未初始化的簇内容，从而获取敏感信息。该漏洞影响所有使用 FatFs 库的嵌入式设备，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6686"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12.763","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:35.823","remediation":"升级至 FatFs R0.16 以上版本，若无法升级则手动修改 ff.c 中 f_lseek() 函数：调用 create_chain() 分配新簇后，使用 move_window() 配合 memset 将每个新分配的簇扇区清零，防止扩展区域暴露已删除文件残留数据。受影响的 ESP-IDF、STM32Cube、Zephyr、MicroPython、ArduPilot、RT-Thread 等下游项目应同步更新其 FatFs 分支。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-uninit-cluster-exposure-cve-2026-6686/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6686.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6686.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/sbom.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6686.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6686.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6686.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_f_lseek_%E8%B6%8A%E7%95%8C%E5%90%8E%E6%9C%AA%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E7%B0%87%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96_CVE-2026-6686.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-h94p-vjqx-v7rr/GHSA-h94p-vjqx-v7rr.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-6686.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6686"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0118.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0117","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0117.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6685","title":"ChaN FatFs 整数下溢越界写入漏洞","description":"CVE-2026-6685 最初被分配用于描述 FatFs 文件系统（ChaN FatFs）中存在的整数下溢漏洞。该漏洞涉及在 f_read() 函数中因无符号减法下溢导致的脏缓存越界写入问题，理论上可导致系统崩溃或数据损坏。然而，经 CVE 编号管理机构（CNA）复核确认，该漏洞判定存在错误，因此本 CVE 编号已被正式拒绝/撤销，不应视为有效安全漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6685"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12.660","updated":"2026-07-16T21:17:22.107","remediation":"该 CVE 已被 CNA 确认为误报并撤销，实际不存在安全漏洞，无需安装任何补丁或采取缓解措施。如果代码中已根据该报告添加了相关修复，建议移除临时补丁以避免不必要的性能开销。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6685.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6685.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/src/ff.c","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6685.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6685.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8B%E6%BA%A2%E8%84%8F%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%E8%B6%8A%E7%95%8C%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5_CVE-2026-6685.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6685.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-rggj-rv54-4gvx/GHSA-rggj-rv54-4gvx.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-6685.json","https://github.com/vulnlog/vulnlog/blob/4faafaeb092f8d2e222dfe40d2065cc31efd2aba/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/get-started/quickstart-report.adoc","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6685"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0116","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6684","title":"ChaN FatFs GPT 分区扫描无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FatFs（ChaN FatFs）在启用 FF_LBA64=1 并使用 GPT 分区扫描功能时存在无限循环漏洞（CWE-835）。攻击者通过向目标设备提供包含特制 GPT 分区表的镜像文件，触发 find_volume() 函数中由 GPTH_PtNum 字段控制的无界循环，导致系统在挂载扫描时陷入长时间阻塞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 FatFs R0.16 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需物理接触目标设备写入特制镜像，攻击条件较为受限，但在嵌入式/IoT 设备场景中仍具有实际威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6684"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12.553","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:25.923","remediation":"建议将 FatFs 升级至 R0.16 或更高版本，该版本已通过 test_gpt_header() 对 GPT 分区条目数上限和 CRC 完整性进行校验，防止恶意分区表触发无限循环。如无法立即升级，可在 ffconf.h 中将 FF_LBA64 设置为 0 以禁用 GPT 分区扫描，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-gpt-scan-loop-dos-cve-2026-6684/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6684.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6684.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/sbom.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6684.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6684.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_GPT_%E5%88%86%E5%8C%BA%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E6%97%A0%E9%99%90%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF_CVE-2026-6684.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6684.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vhc7-qgwj-vx6v/GHSA-vhc7-qgwj-vx6v.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-6684.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6684"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0116.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0115","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6683","title":"ChaN FatFs exFAT 除零错误漏洞","description":"FatFs（ChaN FatFs）R0.16 及更早版本的 exFAT 文件系统同步逻辑中存在除零错误漏洞。当攻击者构建特制的 exFAT 镜像，使 BPB_NumClusEx 字段值为 0 时，在调用 sync_fs() 写同步操作过程中会触发除零异常，导致程序崩溃或拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞需物理接触设备或通过网络分发恶意更新介质触发，影响使用 FatFs 的嵌入式系统、IoT 设备及固件环境，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6683"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12.443","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:07.643","remediation":"立即升级至 FatFs R0.16 或更高版本。R0.16 已包含部分挂载时的除数检查保护，可降低触发风险。对于无法升级的嵌入式系统，可在 sync_fs() 函数入口处增加 n_fatent <= 2 的提前返回检查，避免除零操作。同时，在挂载外部 exFAT 卷前校验 BPB_NumClusEx 字段，若为零则拒绝挂载该卷。上游 runZero 已在 GitHub 发布补丁示例（https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance），建议参考集成。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-exfat-divide-by-zero-cve-2026-6683","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6683.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6683.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/src/ff.c","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6683.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6683.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_exFAT_%E9%99%A4%E9%9B%B6%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF_CVE-2026-6683.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6683.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-74cg-p8q3-4c3q/GHSA-74cg-p8q3-4c3q.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-6683.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6683"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0114","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6682","title":"ChaN FatFs FAT32 整数溢出漏洞","description":"FatFs（ChaN FatFs）R0.16 及之前版本的 FAT32 文件系统挂载函数 mount_volume() 中存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。当攻击者构造一个 BPB_FATSz32 字段值为 0x80000001 的恶意 FAT32 镜像时，fasize 与 fs->n_fats 的乘法运算会发生整数回绕，导致后续读取操作的偏移量和长度被攻击者控制。该漏洞允许物理接触的攻击者通过挂载特制 FAT32 镜像实现任意内存读取或代码执行，在 OTA/固件更新场景下也可远程触发。CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6682"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12.313","updated":"2026-07-02T14:37:48.377","remediation":"立即从 https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/ 下载并应用 FatFs R0.16 的 2026 年 7 月 10 日最新补丁，或在 mount_volume() 中 fasize *= fs->n_fats 运算前添加整数溢出检查：if (fs->n_fats > 0 && fasize > UINT_MAX / fs->n_fats) return FR_INT_ERR；同时校验 BPB_FATSz32 字段值不超过合法范围作为深层防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-fat32-int-of-mnt-cve-2026-6682/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6682.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6682.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/src/ff.c","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_2_CVE-2026-6682.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6682.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6682.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_FAT32_%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA_CVE-2026-6682.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6682.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-c25x-vcg6-4ccx/GHSA-c25x-vcg6-4ccx.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/harness/rce_demo.c","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6682"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0239","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13149","title":"brace-expansion 大括号扩展拒绝服务漏洞","description":"brace-expansion 是 Node.js 生态中广泛使用的字符串展开库，其 expand() 函数在处理连续非扩展 {} 组时存在指数级时间复杂度缺陷（O(2ⁿ)）。攻击者仅需构造约 90 字节（30 个分组）的短 ASCII 字符串即可触发该缺陷，导致 Node.js 单线程事件循环被长时间阻塞，轻则分钟级挂起，重则进程彻底卡死。由于 brace-expansion 被大量上层包间接依赖（如 glob、npm 等），攻击面广。该漏洞影响至 5.0.6 版本，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高。max 选项仅限制输出数量而非递归计算量，无法缓解此问题。目前无官方补丁，建议停止使用或限制输入字符串长度。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13149","GHSA-3jxr-9vmj-r5cp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-30T10:16:34.560","updated":"2026-07-08T12:17:20.087","remediation":"立即将 brace-expansion 升级至 5.0.7 或以上版本（npm install brace-expansion@latest），该版本已修复 expand() 函数对连续非扩展 {} 组的指数级时间复杂度问题。注意 max 选项仅限制输出数组大小而非递归深度，无法作为有效缓解措施，必须通过版本升级修复。如无法升级，可在调用 expand() 前对输入字符串中连续非扩展 {} 组的数量进行限制（建议不超过 10 组），或改用其他不依赖递归展开的 brace expansion 实现。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/c7e33ec13ac1a684c116720843ce24e208611754","https://www.npmjs.com/package/brace-expansion","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13149.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-13149.json","https://github.com/crowi/crowi/blob/b160978375b5c2f90db7de6a642c0e6134c13406/.changeset/brace-expansion-redos-fix.md","https://github.com/snyk/broker/blob/863ecf8f94711ff992fef80b113f55de8b5e7c5f/.snyk","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/brace-expansion/CVE-2026-13149.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-13149.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-13149","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13149.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-13149.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-13149.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0241","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0241.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13676","title":"fast-uri IDN主机名规范化工不当漏洞","description":"fast-uri 是一个 Node.js URL 解析库，其 2.3.1 至 4.0.0 版本在处理 Unicode/IDN 主机名时存在规范化工缺陷。该库调用不存在的全局 URL 辅助函数进行 IDN 转换，导致 TypeError 被静默吞入 parsed.error，而 parse()、normalize()、equal() 等函数仍返回未规范化的 Unicode 形式主机名。攻击者可通过构造含全角字符的 URL（如 http://127。0。0。1/）绕过基于主机名的安全策略（黑名单、环回过滤、重定向验证、出站代理路由），因为 fast-uri 与 Node 原生 URL 解析器对同一输入解析出不同主机。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响使用 fast-uri 进行主机策略校验的 Node.js 应用。建议升级至 3.1.3 或 4.0.1 版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13676","GHSA-4c8g-83qw-93j6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-29T14:16:47.967","updated":"2026-07-21T12:17:19.800","remediation":"升级 fast-uri 至 3.1.3（3.x 分支）或 4.0.1（4.x 分支）。如无法升级，在主机策略检查前拒绝所有非 ASCII 主机名，或使用与后续实际请求相同的 URL 解析器执行策略校验，避免因解析差异导致绕过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/fastify/fast-uri/security/advisories/GHSA-4c8g-83qw-93j6","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:37186","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:37585","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:37628","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:40118","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:40262","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:40945","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:41066","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:41928","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:41929","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-13676","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2494197","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-13676.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13676.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-13676.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-29/TIER_2_CVE-2026-13676.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/fast-uri/CVE-2026-13676.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-13676","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-13676.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-13676.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13676.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/45bc652ff79f8949ca15d5de89590